			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* russian translate by @zhabiy707 in https://github.com/DirtWithWaterz/hbm-ntm-1.20.1-forge/pull/6\n* Add Ukrainian localization  by @MarokoVo in https://github.com/DirtWithWaterz/hbm-ntm-1.20.1-forge/pull/9\n* Update ru_ru.json by @intelcore13900k in https://github.com/DirtWithWaterz/hbm-ntm-1.20.1-forge/pull/8\n* Use the master branch in the build workflow by @Nadwey in https://github.com/DirtWithWaterz/hbm-ntm-1.20.1-forge/pull/10\n* like 30 new blocks/items. Missing textures, functionality, etc. but I keep getting asked for an update (jokingly or not)\n* slight performance improvement to servers/clients (use chunk pregen)\n* new radiation system overhaul by me- permanent damage and other effects- (subject to change) you won't know what hit you till it's already too late\n\n## New Contributors\n* @zhabiy707 made their first contribution in https://github.com/DirtWithWaterz/hbm-ntm-1.20.1-forge/pull/6\n* @MarokoVo made their first contribution in https://github.com/DirtWithWaterz/hbm-ntm-1.20.1-forge/pull/9\n* @intelcore13900k made their first contribution in https://github.com/DirtWithWaterz/hbm-ntm-1.20.1-forge/pull/8\n* @Nadwey made their first contribution in https://github.com/DirtWithWaterz/hbm-ntm-1.20.1-forge/pull/10\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DirtWithWaterz/hbm-ntm-1.20.1-forge/compare/v1.8.21-alpha...1.40.0-alpha"
