			"notes": "fuck uhhhhhhhh I don't wanna write this out all nice\n\n## New\nHazmat suits (revamped and retextured all the models myself, you're welcome):\n- basic\n- advanced\n- high-performance\n\nm65 gas mask\n\nall filters that are attachable to masks:\n- mono\n- basic\n- combo\n- radon\n\nlots of pretty tooltips\n\nAdded the ability for radiation to contaminate inventory items\n\nContaminated item entities radiate their surrounding area\n\nAdded radiation resistance from armors\n\nUn-Racisted radiation (mobs are affected/killed/mutated by radiation now)\n\nAdded Geiger Counter GUI (the little rad counter at the bottom of the screen)\n\nChanged out old 1.7.10 geiger audio for newer 1.12.2 audio cause it sounds nicer\n\nWOO NEW DEPENDANCY - GeckoLib (cuz why tf would I write a renderer from scratch when this one can do everything it'd be able to but better and more efficient???)\n\nAnd Japanese Localization (All thanks to Twister)\n\n## Fixed\nSave/load for radiation data across chunks and worlds\n\nradiation pass through blocks was programmed incorrectly, causing radiation to break\n\n## Changed\nChanged resistance of rad_resistant_block to dog-shit (cuz I can)\n\n## Join my [discord](https://discord.gg/fkbaR7aefK) server for support/bug reports and progress updates"
