			"notes": "## **Added**\n\n- Radiation\n  - Spreads in the 3rd dimension. beautiful, radiating even. Can also be contained by rad resistant blocks, I'm so cool.\n  - use blocks with high density or radiation will leak (use multiple layers for best results*)\n  - (Only has negative effects on players)\n  - Chunk Radiation\n  - Entity Radiation\n  - Block Radiation\n  - Item Radiation\n\n\n- Titanium Ingot (+ore+blocks+raw+nugget)\n- Uranium Ingot (+ore+blocks+raw+powder+nugget+crystal+billet+pilerod)\n- Beryllium Ingot\n- Iron Plate\n\n- Reacher\n  - Reduces radiation per second of the item in other hand by it's square root\n- Geiger Counter\n  - displays radioactive data and counts rad/s when in inventory\n \n\n- Radiation Resistant Block\n  - for test purposes. \n  - It blocks the same amount of radiation as a meter cubed of lead\n- Radiation Decontaminator\n  - decontaminates you (mY DeCOntAminATOr pARtiCLeS aRe bETteR thAN yOuR DeCOntAminATOr pARTiCLeS BoBB)\n  - missing GUI (to be implemented)\n\n\n- Nuclear Creeper\n  - doesn't have a mushroom cloud yet (we'll get there)\n\n\n- All damage types and sources are registered\n  - this part took hours because of the difference in API, thank god it's over.... I love foreshadowing\n\n\n## Join my [discord](https://discord.gg/fkbaR7aefK) server for support/bug reports and progress updates"
